# Claude Code
# .claude/settings.json IS committed (project-shared agent permissions).
# The entries below are session machinery: today they exist only as sandbox
# path-mask phantoms (char devices visible to sandboxed git status, absent
# from the real filesystem); if any ever becomes real it is local-only state.
# .mcp.json may carry MCP server env/credentials -- if a shareable MCP config
# is ever wanted, commit a credential-free .mcp.json.example instead.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agents
.claude/loop.md
.claude/output-styles
.claude/routines
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/workflows
.mcp.json
